===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|da|/kɒmə/|[ˈkʰʌmə]|[ˈkʰʌmm̩]}}
* {{rhymes|da|ɒmə}}

===Verb===
{{head|da|verb|imperative|kom|present|kommer|past|kom|present participle|kommende|past participle||common|kommen|neuter|kommet|definite and plural|komne}}

# to [[come]]
#: {{ux|da|'''Kom''' med mig|Come with me}}
# to [[get]]
# {{lb|da|intransitive}} To [[appear]], to [[manifest]] itself; [[come]]
#: {{ux|da|Smerten i benet '''kommer''' og går|The pain in his leg '''comes''' and goes.}}
